msgid "Toy Mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:51
#: 1386108807724591ae8dc664e3b14aa6
msgid "The Skyviper has Toy Mode set by default. Toy Mode handles the following functions, specific to the Sky Viper 2450GPS:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:53
#: 1308710d4b6b448d91e4b202bbd60b3a
msgid "Handles the button presses from the transmitter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:54
#: d9784e44df6444b68b0709dd6e8c1724
msgid "Magically trims the sticks when they're idle and the SV is disarmed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:55
#: 1e41223f48674f839833cdf444e2f824
msgid "Toggles the fence on and off depending on the situation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:56
#: 2f621c50435947ea9a9a6d20d613e481
msgid "Basically, if GPS is \"good\", the fence is armed, if GPS is \"not good\", the fence is disarmed (for obvious reasons)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:57
#: cca73286852148b4866a9081924eff0f
msgid "Toy Mode also handles moving you between ALT_HOLD and LOITER automatically depending on GPS Status."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:58
#: 632341ef872147f6a7f83bac7b918d2b
msgid "Handles the LED bling (source: peterbarker)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:59
#: 281cc7741fba4cd682c59b0f8341a951
msgid "Toy Mode automatically adjusts the thrust based on voltage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:60
#: 17105959723c40d19dc6185df35a3bd3
msgid "Toy Mode processes an arming script when armed using the throttle control to prevent sudden climbs (idles motors for a moment before increasing speed)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket.rst:61
#: b201e1c3217c4e42b3bbc8496d5f2a6a
msgid "Performs some automatic Compass tuning if needed"
msgstr ""

